<title>CANADA: Quebec offers lower payroll tax for small firms.</title>
<headline>Quebec offers lower payroll tax for small firms.</headline>
<dateline>QUEBEC CITY 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Quebec government said on Thursday that it plans to cut corporate payroll taxes in the province by a total of C$85 million.</p>
<p>The new measures will only apply to businesses, mainly small- and medium-sized companies, that hire new employees. Quebec said it expects that 15,000 jobs will be created under the lower tax scheme.</p>
<p>((Reuters Montreal bureau 514-985-2434))</p>
</text>
